      "0": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "FREQUENCY TO BPM\n\nThis node translates a frequency into a BPM where 1hz equald 60 bpm.\n\nIn this example we control the frequency of the Sine with a Float In node. This frequency is also converted to BPM and send over OSC to another application every time there is a change to the Float In. This is a simple way to sync an oscillator to something in another application."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 164.24685668945312,
          "width": 661.3009033203125,
          "x": 397.7047119140625,
          "y": -15.724777221679686
        },
        "class": {
          "id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
          "version": 0
